uments, and acknowledged me that the same is of free and voluntary act and deed, in the capacity in which she appeared.</span></span></div>\n\n			<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:7pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; This document refers to a contract of lease which consists of seven (7) pages including this page where the acknowledgment is written and signed and instrumental witnesses at the left hand margin of each and every page thereof.</span></span></div>\n\n			<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:7pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">WITNESS MY NOTARIAL SEAL on the date and place first herein above written.</span></span></div>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td>\n			<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:7pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Doc. No. ______</span></span></div>\n\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:7pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Page No. _____</span></span></div>\n\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:7pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Book No. _____</span></span></div>\n\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:7pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Series of 20___</span></span></div>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n	</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><br />\n&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n'),(9,'Proposal','PROPOSAL_#2','PROPOSAL_#2','<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&nbsp;LEASE PROPOSAL</span></span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><strong>|ProposalCreateDate|</strong></span></span><br />\n<br />\n<span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">|BillProContactName|</span></span></div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">|BillProContactDesignation|</span></span></div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">|CompanyName|</span></span></div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">|CompanyAddress|</span></span></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Dear Mr/ Ms <strong>|BillProContactLastName|</strong>,</span></span></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">We are pleased to offer you a space in our <strong>|MallName|</strong>, located at <strong>|MallAddress|</strong>.<br />\nHereunder are the basic lease terms and conditions of our proposed space for your consideration.</span></span></div>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:769px\">\n	<tbody>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"width:281px\">\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">TRADE NAME</span></span></div>\n			</td>\n			<td style=\"width:481px\">\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><strong>&nbsp;|TradeName|</strong></span></span></div>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"width:281px\">\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">NATURE OF BUSINESS</span></span></div>\n			</td>\n			<td style=\"width:481px\">\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><strong>&nbsp;|Industry|</strong></span></span></div>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"width:281px\">\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">LOCATION</span></span></div>\n			</td>\n			<td style=\"width:481px\">\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><strong>&nbsp;|UnitList|</strong></span></span></div>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"width:281px\">\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">FLOOR AREA</span></span></div>\n			</td>\n			<td style=\"width:481px\">\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><strong>&nbsp;|UnitListArea|</strong></span></span></div>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"width:281px\">\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">|RentalScheme|</span></span></div>\n			</td>\n			<td style=\"width:481px\">\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><strong>&nbsp;Php&nbsp;|MonthlyRent|&nbsp;</strong></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><strong>per month + 12% VAT</strong></span></span></div>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"width:281px\">\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">CUSA</span></span></div>\n			</td>\n			<td style=\"width:481px\">\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><strong>&nbsp;Php |getCUSA|&nbsp;per month + 12% VAT</strong></span></span></div>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"width:281px\">\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">AIRCON</span></span></div>\n			</td>\n			<td style=\"width:481px\">\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><strong>&nbsp;Php&nbsp;|getACU|&nbsp;per month + 12% VAT</strong></span></span></div>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"width:281px\">\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">ELECTRICITY</span></span></div>\n			</td>\n			<td style=\"width:481px\">\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><strong>&nbsp;Per Kilowatt-hour consumed + applicable service charge + 12% VAT</strong></span></span></div>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"width:281px\">\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">WATER</span></span></div>\n			</td>\n			<td style=\"width:481px\">\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><strong>&nbsp;Per cubic-meter consumed + applicable service charge + 12% VAT</strong></span></span></div>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"width:281px\">\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">SECURITY DEPOSIT</span></span></div>\n			</td>\n			<td style=\"width:481px\">\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><strong>&nbsp;|SecDepMonth|&nbsp;month(s) basic rent</strong></span></span></div>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"width:281px\">\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">ADVANCE RENT</span></span></div>\n			</td>\n			<td style=\"width:481px\">\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><strong>&nbsp;|AdvMonth| month(s) basic rent+CUSA+AIRCON+12% VAT</strong></span></span></div>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"width:281px\">\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">CONSTRUCTION BOND</span></span></div>\n			</td>\n			<td style=\"width:481px\">\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><strong>&nbsp;|ConDepMonth|&nbsp;month basic rent</strong></span></span></div>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"width:281px\">\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">LEASE TERM</span></span></div>\n			</td>\n			<td style=\"width:481px\">\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><strong>&nbsp;|LeaseTerm| with option to renew</strong></span></span></div>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"width:281px\">\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">ANNUAL INCREMENT</span></span></div>\n			</td>\n			<td style=\"width:481px\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><strong>&nbsp;(|EscaRate|%) annually</strong></span></span></td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"width:281px\">\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">TURN OVER DATE</span></span></div>\n			</td>\n			<td style=\"width:481px\">\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><strong>&nbsp;To be confirmed</strong></span></span></div>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"width:281px\">\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">COMMENCEMENT DATE</span></span></div>\n			</td>\n			<td style=\"width:481px\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><strong>&nbsp;To be confirmed</strong></span></span></td>\n		</tr>\n	</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><em>Note: All rental and other charges are exclusive of Value Added Tax which shall be for the account of the LESSEE.</em></span></span></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The foregoing terms are (a) simultaneously being offered to other prospective tenants and (b) subject to our management&rsquo;s final approval after we have received your confirmation. We shall provide you the formal award notice and lease contract after management&rsquo;s final approval of the terms hereof.</span></span></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Should you have any other queries, please call <strong>|ProposalPrepareBy|</strong> at telephone number <strong>|MallTelephone|</strong>, mobile number&nbsp;<strong>|ProposalPreparedByMobile|</strong> or send an e-mail to <strong>|ProposalPreparedByEmail|</strong>.</span></span></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Thank you.</span></span></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:821px\">\n	<tbody>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"width:257px\">\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Very truly yours,</span></span></div>\n			</td>\n			<td style=\"width:281px\">\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Noted by:</span></span></div>\n			</td>\n			<td style=\"width:269px\">\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Conforme:</span></span></div>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"width:257px\">\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><strong>|ProposalPrepareBy|</strong></span></span></div>\n\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><strong>|ProposalPreparedByRole|</strong></span></span></div>\n\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">LTS Malls, Inc.</span></span></div>\n			</td>\n			<td style=\"width:281px\">\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><strong>|ProposalFirstApprover|</strong></span></span></div>\n\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><strong>|ProposalFirstApproverRole|</strong></span></span></div>\n\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">LTS Malls, Inc.</span></span></div>\n			</td>\n			<td style=\"width:269px\">\n			<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n			<div>\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><strong>|BillProContactName|</strong></span></span>\n\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><strong>|BillProContactDesignation|</strong></span></span></div>\n\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><strong>|CompanyName|</strong></span></span></div>\n			</div>\n			</div>\n\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">DATE: _________________</span></span></div>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n	</tbody>\n</table>\n'),(10,'AwardNotice','AWARD_NOTICE_#2','AWARD_NOTICE_#2','<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><strong>AWARD NOTICE</strong></span></span></p>\n\n<div>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">|AwardNoticeSentDate|</span></span></strong></p>\n\n<div><strong><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">|BillProContactName|<br />\n|BillProContactDesignation|<br />\n|CompanyName|<br />\n|CompanyAddress|</span></span></strong></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Dear Mr/ Ms |BillProContactLastName|,</span></span></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">We are pleased to offer you a space in our |MallName|, located at |MallAddress|.<br />\nHereunder are the basic lease terms and conditions of our proposed space for your consideration.</span></span></div>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:673px\">\n	<tbody>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"width:244px\">\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">TRADE NAME</span></span></div>\n			</td>\n			<td style=\"width:419px\">\n			<div><strong><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&nbsp;|TradeName|</span></span></strong></div>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"width:244px\">\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">NATURE OF BUSINESS</span></span></div>\n			</td>\n			<td style=\"width:419px\">\n			<div><strong><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&nbsp;|Industry|</span></span></strong></div>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"width:244px\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">ADDRESS OF LESSEE</span></span></td>\n			<td style=\"width:419px\">\n			<div><strong>&nbsp;|CompanyAddress|</strong></div>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"width:244px\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">SUBJECT OF LEASE</span></span></td>\n			<td style=\"width:419px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&nbsp;|MallName|</span></span></strong></td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"width:244px\">\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">LOCATION CODE</span></span></div>\n			</td>\n			<td style=\"width:419px\">\n			<div><strong><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&nbsp;|UnitList|</span></span></strong></div>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"width:244px\">\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">LEASE AREA</span></span></div>\n			</td>\n			<td style=\"width:419px\">\n			<div><strong><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&nbsp;|UnitListArea|</span></span></strong></div>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"width:244px\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">DATE OF TURNOVER (CONSTRUCTION)</span></span></td>\n			<td style=\"width:419px\"><strong>&nbsp;|TurnOverDate|</strong></td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"width:244px\">\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">START OF LEASE</span></span></div>\n			</td>\n			<td style=\"width:419px\">\n			<div><strong>&nbsp;|LeaseStartDate|</strong></div>\n\n			<div><em><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&nbsp;*Tenant may operate before the start of commencement date once all&nbsp; </span></span></em></div>\n\n			<div><em><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&nbsp;requirements are&nbsp;</span></span></em><em><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">complied.</span></span></em></div>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"width:244px\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">LEASE TERMINATION DATE</span></span></td>\n			<td style=\"width:419px\"><strong>&nbsp;|LeaseTerminationDate|</strong></td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"width:244px\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">LEASE TERM</span></span></td>\n			<td style=\"width:419px\"><strong>&nbsp;|LeaseTerm|</strong></td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"width:244px\">\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">BASIC MONTHLY RENTAL</span></span></div>\n			</td>\n			<td style=\"width:419px\">\n			<div><strong><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&nbsp;Php&nbsp;|MonthlyRent| per month + 12% VAT</span></span></strong></div>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"width:244px\">\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">CUSA</span></span></div>\n			</td>\n			<td style=\"width:419px\">\n			<div><strong><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&nbsp;Php |getCUSA|&nbsp;per month + 12% VAT</span></span></strong></div>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"width:244px\">\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">AIRCON</span></span></div>\n			</td>\n			<td style=\"width:419px\">\n			<div><strong><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&nbsp;Php&nbsp;|getACU|&nbsp;per month + 12% VAT</span></span></strong></div>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"width:244px\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">ADS &amp; PROMO FUND</span></span></td>\n			<td style=\"width:419px\">&nbsp;</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"width:244px\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">ESCALATION ON FIXED RENT/ANNUM</span></span></td>\n			<td style=\"width:419px\"><strong>&nbsp;|EscaRate|% annually</strong></td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"width:244px\">\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">CGLI &amp; FIRE INSURANCE</span></span></div>\n			</td>\n			<td style=\"width:419px\">\n			<div><strong><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&nbsp;Php 500,000 minimum coverage</span></span></strong></div>\n\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&nbsp;Lessee shall furnish Lessor with a copy of the insurance policy</span></span></div>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"width:244px\">\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">SECURITY DEPOSIT</span></span></div>\n			</td>\n			<td style=\"width:419px\">\n			<div><strong><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">|SecDepMonthinWords| (|SecDepMonth|) months basic rent or |TotalSecDepWords| (Php&nbsp;</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">|TotalSecDepAmount|)</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> to be reimbursed to the LESSEE, less whatever&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">charges legally collectible, upon expiration of the Lease Contract. The&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Security Deposit shall be fixed.</span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&nbsp;The Security Deposit shall be forfeited if the&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">agreement is cancelled AFTER confirmation of this Award Notice or&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">termination of the Lease Contract for whatever reason PRIOR to the</span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&nbsp;expiration of the term.&nbsp;</span></span></div>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"width:244px\">\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">ADVANCE RENT</span></span></div>\n			</td>\n			<td style=\"width:419px\">\n			<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&nbsp;|AdvMonthinWords| (|AdvMonth|) months basic rent, CUSA and Aircon </span></span></strong><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">plus Twelve&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&nbsp;percent (12%) Value Added Tax equivalent to <strong>|TotalAdvWords| (Php&nbsp; </strong></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><strong>&nbsp;|TotalAdvAmount|)</strong>. The Advance Rent is applicable on the first two (2) </span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&nbsp;months of operation.</span></span></p>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"width:244px\">\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">CONSTRUCTION BOND</span></span></div>\n			</td>\n			<td style=\"width:419px\">\n			<p><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">A cash bond equivalent to</span></span><strong><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> |ConDepMonthinWords| (|ConDepMonth|) month basic rent,</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&nbsp;</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">equivalent to <strong>|TotalConBondWords| (Php |TotalConBondAmount|)</strong> payable </span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&nbsp;prior to the start of construction to answer for all violations or&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">non-</span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&nbsp;compliance of guidelines, requirements or deviations from the&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">approved </span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">plans. Said amount shall be refunded to Lessee upon issuance </span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&nbsp;by the Malls </span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&nbsp;Administration of Lessee&rsquo;s clearance to begin store operation.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"width:244px\">\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">CONTRACTOR&rsquo;S ALL RISK INSURANCE</span></span></div>\n			</td>\n			<td style=\"width:419px\">\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&nbsp;Php 500,000 minimum coverage</span></span></div>\n\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&nbsp;Lessee shall furnish Lessor with a copy of the insurance policy.</span></span></div>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"width:244px\">\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">CHEQUE PAYMENTS PAYABLE TO</span></span></div>\n			</td>\n			<td style=\"width:419px\">\n			<div><strong><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&nbsp;|MallCompanyName|</span></span></strong></div>\n\n			<div><strong><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&nbsp;NAME OF BANK and ACCOUNT NUMBER</span></span></strong></div>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"width:244px\">\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">TAXES</span></span></div>\n			</td>\n			<td style=\"width:419px\">\n			<p><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&nbsp;Real Estate Tax on the land and building as well as the withholding tax (5%) </span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&nbsp;on rental shall be borne by the LESSOR while the (12%) value added tax </span></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&nbsp;(VAT) on the rental shall be for the account of the LESSEE.</span></span></p>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"width:244px\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">DOCUMENTARY STAMP TAX</span></span></td>\n			<td style=\"width:419px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&nbsp;LESSEE&rsquo;S ACCOUNT</span></span></strong></td>\n		</tr>\n	</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">If you agree to the foregoing, please sign on the space provided below to indicate your conformity and return to us two (2) copies together with the cheques amounting <strong>Php |TotalSecDepAmount|</strong>, <strong>Php |TotalAdvAmount|</strong> and <strong>Php |TotalConBondAmount|</strong> representing the total Security Deposit, Advance Rent and Construction Bond respectively, within ten (10) days from receipt of this Award Notice. Non-payment within the given period shall mean cancellation of this notice. </span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Requests for considerations and all any other reasons of delay must be communicated either through email or written letter. Non-confirmation within thirty (30) days upon receipt of this Award Notice shall mean cancellation of the awarded space.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">In the event that the original signatory is not available, a confirmation from the official representative of the company is needed. In the absence of signed hard copies, signed and scanned copy shall be accepted. </span></span></p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Any cancellation made by the Lessee through written notice addressed to and properly received by LTS Malls, Inc. Leasing Department within fifteen (15) calendar days from date of payment of the Security Deposit and Advance Rent shall entitle the Lessee a refund equivalent to 50% of the payments made. If notice of cancellation is submitted beyond the 15 calendar-day period, the full amount of the Security Deposit and Advance Rental shall be forfeited.</span></span></strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">|MallCompanyName| reserves the right to revoke this notice. All other terms and conditions shall be set forth in the Contract of Lease. </span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Thank you for the partnership that you have afforded us.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:669px\">\n	<tbody>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"width:358px\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Prepared by:</span></span></td>\n			<td style=\"width:304px\">\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Noted by:</span></span></div>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"width:358px\">\n			<div><strong><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">|AwardSenderName|</span></span></strong></div>\n\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">|AwardSenderRole|</span></span></div>\n\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">|MallCompanyName|</span></span></div>\n			</td>\n			<td style=\"width:304px\">\n			<div><strong><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">|AwardFirstApprover|</span></span></strong></div>\n\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">|AwardFirstApproverRole|</span></span></div>\n\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">|MallCompanyName|</span></span></div>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"height:14px; width:358px\">\n			<p>&nbsp;</p>\n			</td>\n			<td style=\"height:14px; width:304px\">\n			<p>&nbsp;</p>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"width:358px\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Approved by:</span></span></td>\n			<td style=\"width:304px\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Conforme:</span></span></td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"width:358px\">\n			<div><strong><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">|AwardSecondApprover|</span></span></strong></div>\n\n			<div><span style=\"font-family:Arial; font-size:9pt\">|AwardSecondApproverRole|</span></div>\n\n			<div><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">|MallCompanyName|</span></span></div>\n			</td>\n			<td style=\"width:304px\">\n			<div><strong><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">|BillProContactName|<br />\n			|BillProContactDesignation|</span></span></strong></div>\n\n			<div><strong><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">|CompanyName|</span></span></strong></div>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"width:358px\">\n			<div>\n			<div>&nbsp;</div>\n			</div>\n			</td>\n			<td style=\"width:304px\">\n			<div><strong><span style=\"font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">DATE: _________________</span></span></strong></div>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n	</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n');

